      "reachedThrough": "next (a production dependency): it is the only copy the running server loads, and at run time Next.js matches image URLs only against image patterns fixed in its configuration: none are configured here, so it applies its own default local pattern `**` and no remote pattern; a visitor supplies only the URL being matched, never a pattern. The build also matches middleware and tracing patterns with it. An older picomatch with no extglob guard at all."
